            ## Objective and Allocated Requirements

            Design contract DSP-STUDY/1, authored by native architect invocation 5a969ff8-f11a-4c48-944f-efbafbe085f9 (signed gpt-6.1-sol/high) for existing workflow VT-FB18E4DC-KNW-0001. This is a proposed frozen interface and allocation baseline for independent review, not source-verified learning content, approved implementation, or acceptance.

