            ## Decisions and Rationale

            New intro_dsp_study namespace avoids restoring deleted filenames and makes task scope reviewable; fresh collision check is still mandatory. Separate page and item ledgers prevent false completeness from one row per slide when a slide contains several examples/diagrams. Separate structured/human reading views support deterministic coverage checks and direct learning use. Stable aliases keep filenames usable while full source identity preserves provenance. Original explanation and bounded paraphrases teach the material without copying exercise collections. Distinct prompt/answer/optional-user-solution paths preserve independent practice. Plain Markdown, JSON/JSONL, SVG/Mermaid and observed available host scripting are sufficient; no app/framework or speculative hardware design.

            Installed software profile remains applicable. Unit coverage applies to actual numerical practice and schema/link validators, with independent oracles and edge cases; integration covers source->inventory->reading->note->exercise->practice links and hashes; system verification is exhaustive source/math/provenance inspection; intended-use validation is actual index walkthrough for every topic. A product application build, firmware unit tests, board/HIL/bench measurement, power budgeting and deployment smoke tests are not applicable because no such executable product is delivered. These dispositions do not waive runnable evidence or software release configuration.

            Release classification is feature, matching saved workflow increment: new usable source-backed study guide/practice, not a restoration or bug-fix claim. Release config must identify scoped documentation/scripts, requirement/design/check/recipe baselines, source identities (private), runtime versions and exact commands, unresolved findings, current evidence and scope-preservation diff. Configured private archive is VuThach3001/VeryThinker-Project-Archives under codex/projects/neolearning-vt-fb18e4dc; visibility/authentication is unverified. Release/manager must confirm it before publication. automatic_pr points to VuThach3001/VeryThinker: only reviewed generalized lesson candidates, not raw course/project sources, and merging remains separately controlled. This architect publishes nothing.

